# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
# L0 operator-controlled — every action is referred to the operator; a human
# approves each step (AI Act Art. 14(4)(d): the operator's ability to decide,
# in any particular situation, not to use the system or to disregard/override/
# reverse its output). The reservation carries no guard, so it matches every
# `agent-action` unconditionally, taking precedence over the grade comparison
# (spec SYNTAX/SPEC.md: reserved is not auto regardless of what an actor is
# granted). grade L0 on the gate is declared for legibility only.
actor agent grade L0
human operator role operator
gate  action risk high grade L0 grant agent
reserve agent-action by operator
cord  agent  -> action
cord  action -> master
